mentation as a reference: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_documentation_comments.html#doc-gdscript-documentation-comments-bbcode-and-class-reference\r\n- **Strikethrough:** I went with `~~` which one of the two supported [GitHub flavored markdown syntax](https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/writing-on-github/getting-started-with-writing-and-formatting-on-github/basic-writing-and-formatting-syntax). I tried using html tags but they're not supported in some code editors.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nClose https://github.com/GDQuest/zed-gdscript/issues/42","closed_by":{"login":"NathanLovato","id":12694995,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk0OTk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12694995?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanLovato","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108497/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108497/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}